\[ 16 \text{ pieces} - 2 \text{ pieces} = 14 \text{ pieces} \]
Each piece costs 20 cents, so the total cost is:
\[ 14 \text{ pieces} \times 20 \text{ cents/piece} = 280 \text{ cents} = 2.80 \text{ euros} \]

