Which one of the following expressions is equal to $D+d$ ? 
Choices:
(A) $(a+b)$
(B) $2(a+b)$
(C) $\frac{1}{2}(a+b)$
(D) $\sqrt{a b}$
(E) $\sqrt{a^{2}+b^{2}}$
