     \text{Area}_{\text{garden}} = \frac{3\sqrt{3}}{2} \left( 4n - 4 \right)
     \]
     \[
     \text{Area}_{\text{garden}} = 6\sqrt{3} (n - 1)
     \]

8. **Finding \( m \):**
