   \[
   6 \times 1 = 6 \text{ square meters}
   \]

2. **Total Surface Area of 14 Cubes:**
   Since there are 14 cubes, the total surface area if they were separate would be:
   \[
   14 \times 6 = 84 \text{ square meters}
   \]

