   \]

5. **Calculating the Side Length of the Octagon:**
   - The side length of the octagon is \( x\sqrt{2} \).
   \[
   x\sqrt{2} = 5(2 - \sqrt{2})\sqrt{2} = 5(2\sqrt{2} - 2) = 10\sqrt{2} - 10
   \]
   - Approximating \( \sqrt{2} \approx 1.414 \):
   \[
   10\sqrt{2} - 10 \approx 10 \times 1.414 - 10 = 14.14 - 10 = 4.14
   \]

