   6^2 = \text{height}^2 + 2^2 \implies 36 = \text{height}^2 + 4 \implies \text{height}^2 = 32 \implies \text{height} = \sqrt{32} = 4\sqrt{2}
   \]

Therefore, the height of the cone is \(\boxed{4\sqrt{2}}\). The correct choice is \(\boxed{D}\).
