     \]
   - Plugging in the values:
     \[
     A = \pi \times 5^2
     \]
     \[
     A = 25\pi \text{ mm}^2
     \]
   - Using \( \pi \approx 3.14159 \):
     \[
     A \approx 25 \times 3.14159
     \]
     \[
     A \approx 78.54 \text{ mm}^2
     \]

3. **Subtract the area covered by the cylinder from the surface area of the prism:**
   - The exposed surface area of the bottom solid figure is:
     \[
     \text{Exposed Surface Area} = 4450 - 78.54
     \]
